### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Nighttime Parking Lot with Wet Surface and Stationary Vehicle" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :roadObject1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :nightCondition1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :description "Wet road surface in a poorly lit parking lot with a stationary vehicle obstructing path" .

:roadObject1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Puddles and wet surface indicating recent rain or poor drainage" .

:nightCondition1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Low visibility due to nighttime lighting" .

:risk1 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Slippery road surface due to standing water, increasing braking distance and collision risk" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Stationary vehicle partially obscuring view of potential pedestrians or obstacles" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .
```

